   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f1352132e60837c4bdf5",
   "sourceHash": "f1352132e60837c4bdf53ad95f4965558e8fe75dc808122c48271525318843fa",
   "text": "全球信赖",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_38e84e7de39fdc882181",
   "sourceHash": "38e84e7de39fdc882181ab9b6c7f592d054aae52ccfeefef700735616e2b3e5e",
   "text": "：Kairali的药品凭借其品质与可靠性，深受全球用户信赖。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9149487a96f2dedc9837",
   "sourceHash": "9149487a96f2dedc983764a51cb2dec59c90f36903bc8271bef214d278245130",
   "text": "全球信赖：Kairali的药品凭借其品质与可靠性，深受全球用户信赖。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_12c123e87529b51edd32",
   "sourceHash": "12c123e87529b51edd32ad37afe462eabb684fc9e19a02892f73e1844eae142c",
   "text": "迈向整体身心健康的一步",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dd5ef70f4fbb07e67cc1",
   "sourceHash": "dd5ef70f4fbb07e67cc161eb2afaa2807b7e84b1c02466a249b947986902efdb",
   "text": "Kairali阿育吠陀专利药品秉承阿育吠陀永恒的理念，为当代健康问题提供安全、天然的调理方案。选择这些药品，除了可针对特定健康问题进行治疗外，还能支持一种有益于身、心、灵的整体健康方式。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a9c071bd4fed5673a079",
   "sourceHash": "a9c071bd4fed5673a07992fe9907a0ee93d183df2458800b9432ddd3ced8d2cd",
   "text": "首页 – 阿育吠陀专利药品",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ea26951f6ff0977131aa",
   "sourceHash": "ea26951f6ff0977131aa9f8621ec5e883e6b9798a11f1659e09c6f082d579d0f",
   "text": "Kairali阿育吠陀有机产品——天然健康养护方案",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e4bf6dcfce2067743680",
   "sourceHash": "e4bf6dcfce2067743680306e3aa20d5346631a16c1bb5737fb6e4bf3935606ec",
   "text": "了解Kairali阿育吠陀有机产品，采用天然、不含化学物质的成分制成。护肤、护发、养生茶等产品，助力整体健康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8c6daca43c915e860586",
   "sourceHash": "8c6daca43c915e860586a884b77ebbfdfc4055203cade90c7baaa688721aa7a6",
   "text": "在当今社会，几乎人人都在寻找有机产品，这表明人们倾向于依靠天然、无害的方式应对健康问题。Kairali的阿育吠陀专利产品正是如此，它们有助于促进个人的内在之美与健康。这些产品经受住了时间的考验，并在阿育吠陀领域持续发挥着重要作用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_248d9f648b8bc20c7341",
   "sourceHash": "248d9f648b8bc20c73416f22bf6afe93302aa73cd92140358fd81e0ecad646f0",
   "text": "致力于有机健康养护",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b8cafe2a2fc9c6aec6fa",
   "sourceHash": "b8cafe2a2fc9c6aec6faa4733d361988645c4f5cbf196899ac9a0b3b75ab2061",
   "text": "丰富多样的有机产品",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7e73b200e2f962fe42f7",
   "sourceHash": "7e73b200e2f962fe42f7cf58c03572acd6c150d3f32b859f6cbf0fc0f3f09baa",
   "text": "Kairali阿育吠陀专利有机产品提供丰富多样的有机产品，满足各种健康养护需求。产品系列包括：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_80fce825603d5b6223f0",
   "sourceHash": "80fce825603d5b6223f0691206617ef5230dc0d2099fd1d3e65b02c47f12979a",
   "text": "有机草本配方",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f146d59ccb767b14f88f",
   "sourceHash": "f146d59ccb767b14f88f53406f7a13ea48a1a83d00877c44ffbd7ccdd370a20b",
   "text": "这些配方采用具有理疗特性的强效草药和植物提取物制成，旨在促进整体健康。每一种组合都旨在恢复和谐，平衡身体的三种督夏（皮塔（Pitta）、卡法（Kapha）和瓦塔（Vata））。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_20af46ed12612ac6b2bd",
   "sourceHash": "20af46ed12612ac6b2bd83dd8bb07ed66a9f385691f17e3f7e64ddd7ba2cec4f",
   "text": "有机草本配方 这些配方采用具有理疗特性的强效草药和植物提取物制成，旨在促进整体健康。每一种组合都旨在恢复和谐，平衡身体的三种督夏（皮塔（Pitta）、卡法（Kapha）和瓦塔（Vata））。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3d93393b7da69cb18a60",
   "sourceHash": "3d93393b7da69cb18a608cd84e9f17d25c59cbb937d60ed3bc8da20751b5ae04",
   "text": "有机护肤产品",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2f733bdf3dd93574ac70",
   "sourceHash": "2f733bdf3dd93574ac708c1fa07689f787a5301fd0b9a9e47d0dd44802b47d99",
   "text": "为滋养、保护和焕活肌肤，该护肤系列包括一款保湿乳液、一款焕颜面部护理油，以及一款添加天然成分的草本面膜。这些产品温和而有效，适合所有肤质使用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
